---
import { readFileSync } from 'node:fs';
import { Code } from 'astro:components';
interface Props {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  file: string;
  exercise: string;
  platform: string;
}
const { id, title, file, exercise, platform } = Astro.props;
const source = readFileSync(file, 'utf8');
---

<section class="code-lab" id="code-lab" aria-labelledby="code-lab-title" data-code-id={id}>
  <p class="eyebrow">
    CODE LAB <span>/ C++20</span>
  </p>
  <h2 id="code-lab-title">代码实验</h2>
  <p>{exercise}</p>
  <a class="primary-button" href="#code-lab" data-open-lab>
    打开 CodeLAB ↗
  </a>
  <noscript>
    <p>启用 JavaScript 后可打开编辑器；示例代码可在上方正文中阅读和复制。</p>
  </noscript>
  <dialog class="lab-dialog" aria-labelledby="lab-topic-title">
    <header class="lab-header">
      <div class="lab-heading">
        <span class="lab-mark">
          C++ <span>/ CODE LAB</span>
        </span>
        <h2 id="lab-topic-title">{title}</h2>
      </div>
      <button type="button" id="close-lab" autofocus>
        返回文章 <span aria-hidden="true">↙</span>
      </button>
    </header>
    <div class="lab-workspace">
      <aside class="lab-instructions" aria-label="实验说明">
        <div class="lab-pane-title">
          实验说明 <span>C++20</span>
        </div>
        <div class="lab-instructions-body">
          <p class="eyebrow">练习目标</p>
          <h3>{title}</h3>
          <p>{exercise}</p>
          <h4>运行说明</h4>
          <p>
            {platform === 'linux'
              ? '示例需要 Linux 系统调用。在线沙箱受限时，可复制到 Linux / WSL 运行。'
              : '示例包含正确性断言，可先运行原始代码，再修改并核对输出。'}
          </p>
          <p>在线机器的计时不适合作为性能基准。</p>
          <details class="lab-original">
            <summary>原始示例</summary>
            <Code code={source} lang="cpp" theme="github-dark" />
          </details>
          <p class="source-note">
            Ctrl / ⌘ + F 查找 · Ctrl / ⌘ + Enter 运行。Tab 用于缩进；Ctrl + M 切换 Tab 的焦点导航。
          </p>
        </div>
      </aside>
      <div
        class="lab-divider"
        role="separator"
        aria-label="调整说明与编辑器宽度"
        aria-orientation="vertical"
        aria-valuemin="25"
        aria-valuemax="65"
        aria-valuenow="38"
        tabindex="0"
      ></div>
      <section class="lab-coding" aria-label="代码编辑与运行">
        <div class="lab-pane-title">
          <span>{id}.cpp</span>
          <span id="code-save-status" role="status">
            自动保存到此浏览器
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="lab-editor-area">
          <div id="monaco-editor" hidden></div>
          <textarea
            id="code-editor"
            aria-label="C++ 代码编辑器"
            spellcheck="false"
            autocomplete="off"
            maxlength="100000"
          >{source}</textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="lab-toolbar">
          <button class="primary-button" type="button" id="run-code">
            运行代码
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="copy-code">
            复制代码
          </button>
          <a href="https://godbolt.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            Compiler Explorer ↗
          </a>
        </div>
        <section class="lab-results" aria-label="运行结果">
          <div class="lab-pane-title">
            运行结果 <span>GCC 13.2 · C++20</span>
          </div>
          <pre id="code-output" aria-live="polite">尚未运行。点击运行代码查看输出。</pre>
        </section>
        <p class="lab-service-note">
          运行会将代码发送到 godbolt.org。参数：-std=c++20 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -pthread。
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </dialog>
  <script src="../scripts/code-lab.ts"></script>
</section>
